+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project uses semantic versioning (semver, major.minor.patch) to number releases; this decision superseded an earlier, since-retired choice of calendar versioning (calver) and was adopted because semver provides a cleaner versioning approach for tracking releases and changes.
